flowchart LR
    START[TrialIQ API startup] --> LLM[One-time LLM provider preflight]
    START --> HEALTH[/GET /health/]
    HEALTH --> ALIVE[API process alive]

    READY[/GET /ready/] --> NEO[Neo4j readiness]
    READY --> MCP[MCP transport readiness]
    READY --> LLMREADY[Configured LLM readiness]

    NEO --> SUMMARY[RuntimeReadiness]
    MCP --> SUMMARY
    LLMREADY --> SUMMARY

    SUMMARY --> PREFLIGHT[demo_preflight.py]
    PREFLIGHT --> AGENT[Live guided TrialIQ probe]
    AGENT --> PASS[API + Neo4j + MCP + LLM + retrieval + metrics + validation + synthesis]
